      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794033530161,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "任何合法串行次序都会让后执行者看到只剩一人，从而拒绝离岗。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "任何合法串行次序都会让后执行者看到只剩一人，从而拒绝离岗。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
